          "author": "Momma Bear Audio",
          "description": "Halloween Case Files is a cozy, kid-friendly mystery adventure set on Halloween at Maple Hollow School. When the annual parade preparations go hilariously wrong, young detective Jax steps in to solve a string of spooky mix-ups — from missing pumpkins and scrambled decorations to glitter explosions and snack-table chaos. Each episode invites listeners to join Jax and his friends as they crack clues, solve puzzles, and uncover the playful “trickster” behind the chaos.Across ten short episodes, children become active participants in the story, thinking through riddles, patterns, and sound clues alongside Jax. The series blends gentle suspense with humor and warmth, creating an immersive listening experience perfect for classrooms, families, or bedtime. With rich sound design, engaging voices, and a satisfying mystery arc, Halloween Case Files celebrates teamwork, problem-solving, and the joy of imagination — all wrapped in the glow of fall festivities.Listeners will love the parade finale, where every solved puzzle comes together for a cheerful Halloween celebration. It’s a delightful mix of detective fun and seasonal magic that encourages curiosity, critical thinking, and laughter.Run Time: 20 min\n\nLooking for other free audio sources, ideas and inspo? Maybe you want to submit a request for some sort of specific audio for your kids? Join my FB Group! I am always taking suggestions and working to get the audio your kids want.\nToyo Momma Bear source: 869c669e43f213aef54f04dac144b4dd59672f545217b48741287acf5c131a10",
